WEBVTT

00:15:25.625 --> 00:15:30.351
But if I've learned anything
over the last five years,

00:15:30.375 --> 00:15:34.101
it is that thinking this way
really does help.

00:15:34.125 --> 00:15:35.726
More than anything,

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:39.726
it has shown me that it is possible

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:43.893
to live and grieve at the same time.

00:15:43.917 --> 00:15:48.059
And for that, I would be always grateful.

00:15:48.083 --> 00:15:49.351
Thank you.

00:15:49.375 --> 00:15:52.417
(Applause)